mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>u</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>u</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Note that we used the substitution <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"232\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we can compute <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"233\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em; margin-left: 0.053em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w